{
    "title": "NumLink - Number Match Puzzle",
    "description": "NumLink - Number Match Puzzle is an interesting and addictive number matching game that will keep you entertained for hours! Train your math skills and boost your mind while enjoying endless fun in this puzzle game! \ud83d\udd22 \r\n\r\nHow to Play:\r\n- Tap pairs with the same value or pairs that sum up to 10 to eliminate them.\r\n- Scan each row carefully. Pairs can be vertical, horizontal, or diagonal.\r\n- Pay attention to the pairs from the end of one row and the beginning of the next.\r\n- Clear the board and try to beat your high score.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n-Easy to play! Hard to master!\r\n-Over 10,000 stages are ready for you to sharpen your mind and train your math skills.\r\n-Rank in league. Win scores in league to participate in rank and win more medals. \r\n-Useful hints to help you win the stages.\r\n-No time limits! No Wi-Fi needed!\r\n\r\nNumLink - Number Match Puzzle is a free number puzzle game that aims to clear all numbers from the board. \ud83d\udcaf If you love classic board game like Sudoku,Make Ten and Numberama, NumLink - Number Match Puzzle is perfect for you! \ud83c\udfaf\r\n\r\nDownload NumLink - Number Match Puzzle to train your brain and enhance your memory. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8cYour feedback matters a lot to us! If you have any question, please email us at: bigcakebiz@gmail.com.\ud83d\udc8c",
